# landmark (assets/world3d/millpond/landmark.set, hand-placed)
# The Royal Dog-Paddle: the mill on the north bank with its tall chimney and hopper, a waterwheel standing in the west pond, stone parapets along the bridge between the ponds.
# the millhouse on the north bank: stone walls, a tiled roof, a tall chimney, a hopper, a lit window
